OL,3,GNEWSAJudges confirm Make a Difference
OL,4,A2026 finalists
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe shortlist of the BBC Radio Jersey
OL,7,FMake a Difference finalists has been
OL,8,Fannounced.
OL,10,FIndependent judges selected four
OL,11,Fnominees that they believed highlighted
OL,12,Fthe best of work that helped others in
OL,13,Fthe island for 2026.
OL,15,FThey include people who help survivors
OL,16,Fof domestic abuse, an African support
OL,17,Fcharity which promotes diversity and
OL,18,Finclusion, a physiotherapy academy and
OL,19,Fan organisation which helps improve the
OL,20,Fphysical and mental wellbeing of older
OL,21,Fpeople.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
